      "description": "A removable filter with a muted category and foreground value.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\"><span>Status</span><strong>Reading</strong><button class=\"ds-chip-remove\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Remove Reading filter\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:max-content;border:1px solid var(--border,rgb(160 180 255 / 13%));border-radius:16px;padding:4px 10px;color:var(--fg-muted,#b0b4c1);font-size:12px;font-family:var(--font-body,\"Mona Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif);}.ds-chip strong{font-weight:500;color:var(--fg,#eef1fa);}.ds-chip-remove{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:24px;min-height:24px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;}.ds-chip-remove:hover{color:var(--fg,#eef1fa);}.ds-chip-remove:focus-visible{outline:1.5px solid var(--focus-ring,#98b1ff);outline-offset:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--focus-halo,rgb(143 168 255 / 10.5%));}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Flat card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "A resting container with a hairline border and no raised shadow.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">Library settings</h3><p class=\"ds-card-description\">Manage this collection.</p><button class=\"ds-card-action\" type=\"button\">Open settings</button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;width:260px;max-width:100%;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--hairline,rgb(160 180 255 / 13%));border-radius:18px;background:var(--surface,#1f222c);color:var(--fg,#eef1fa);font-size:14px;font-family:var(--font-body,\"Mona Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif);}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375;}.ds-card-description{margin:0;color:var(--fg-muted,#b0b4c1);}.ds-card-action{align-self:flex-start;height:34px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--hairline,rgb(160 180 255 / 13%));border-radius:9px;background:var(--sheet-ground,#0a0d16);color:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-body,\"Mona Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif);}.ds-card-action:hover{background:var(--surface-2,#262933);}.ds-card-action:active{background:var(--surface-3,#2e313b);}.ds-card-action:focus-visible{outline:1.5px solid var(--focus-ring,#98b1ff);outline-offset:0;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--focus-halo,rgb(143 168 255 / 10.5%));}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The book collection",
    "overview": "The collection supplies the imagery and colour. A floating navigation bar sits above one rounded catalogue sheet,\nwith compact controls and ruled table rows. Covers retain their own artwork rather than adopting the interface palette.\n\nMona Sans carries the interface. Periwinkle marks primary actions, selection, focus, and reading progress. The dark\npalette places a near-black sheet inside an ink-navy shell; light uses cool pale grounds, and Monochrome uses graphite.\nThe interface has no decorative texture. Existing generated covers retain their cloth textures and metallic detail.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One catalogue sheet beneath a translucent navigation bar.",
      "Compact controls, quiet rows, and visible book covers.",
      "Theme-following semantic colours with separate, fixed cover artwork.",
      "Local edit feedback and reduced-motion alternatives."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The semantic colour rule",
        "body": "Interface elements use semantic roles; fixed artwork keeps its own palette.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The floating depth rule",
        "body": "Resting cards stay flat; floating controls carry the raised shadow.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep interface colours on semantic roles so all palettes use the same components.",
      "Do keep book artwork and its generated-cover texture separate from interface styling.",
      "Do use the raised shadow for floating controls and flat borders for resting cards.",
      "Do keep edit feedback in its owning context and preserve reduced-motion alternatives."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't apply the generated covers' decorative texture or metallic detail to interface controls.",
      "Don't use the error hue as a general attention accent.",
      "Don't add shelf tabs or a collapsing Library header to the documented composition.",
      "Don't treat deferred reading totals, attention counts, filter counts, or additional sortable columns as built UI."
    ]
  }
